            "text": "The seven-token construction reaches both targets to floating-point precision. A single-heavy-token distribution does not: when its forward KL is 10, its backward KL is only about 2.05. I’ll now save the working method in a script, add validation and tests, and generate `/app/dist.npy`.\n"
          }
